WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.160
Is anyone there?

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:25.900
Luca!

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.440
No, Luca is...

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:30.570
Jack...

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.900
Why is this happening?

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:40.320
I activate the Continuous Spell 
Lock On Laser from my hand.

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:49.150
If you set a card in the Spell & Trap Card 
Zone, you takes 200 points of damage.

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:56.880
The more moves you make, 
the more life you'll pay.

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:58.610
Bringing you closer to the end.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:02.120
Those two can't move anymore.

00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:09.210
Does your heart hurt?

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:12.940
Humans hold on to foolish 
hopes because of their hearts.

00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:18.110
Those hopes are easily destroyed, 
leaving them squirming in pain.

00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:19.690
Pathetic.

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:24.040
If you didn't have hearts, the future 
wouldn't have been destroyed.

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:28.810
Kid, this is despair.

00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:30.990
I end my turn.

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:35.270
Riding Duels.

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:38.380
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:45.270
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:52.990
Run!  The road of evolution leading to tomorrow

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:57.360
Is a new legendary duel

00:02:09.870 --> 00:02:14.450
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:20.080
Set free your infinite potential

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:25.520
Every beginning is up to you

00:02:26.060 --> 00:02:32.030
Everyone is lost  Pursue the light

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:37.400
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:43.240
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:51.020
Become the gale and dance  Cut through the darkness

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:56.390
Even if you can't see your destination

00:02:56.550 --> 00:03:01.930
Run on your feet without fear

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:07.470
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:14.510
Going my way!!  Break through and go!

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:34.360
Life-and-Death Battle!
Meklord Astro Dragon Asterisk

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:46.860
Power Gravity is destroyed 
during this End Phase, so

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:50.520
Meklord Army of Wisel's attack 
points return to normal.

00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:04.320
It's my fault.

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:09.330
Luca and Jack got hurt because I 
stuck my nose where it didn't belong.

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:12.540
It's not over.

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:15.880
Did you think this was enough to defeat me?

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:18.350
Jack!

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:20.320
Luca!

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:24.130
Lua, we haven't lost yet.

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:26.510
So don't lose hope!

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:29.270
But what can I do?

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:29.680
Lua!

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:32.570
That's right.

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:37.550
I have to try my best too.

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:40.080
My turn!

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:42.680
So you're going to fight me.

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:46.900
But due to Level Cannon, when 
you summon a monster, you

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:50.000
take damage equal to its Level 
multiplied by 200 points.

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:53.570
And due to Lock On Laser, 
you take 200 points of

00:04:53.570 --> 00:04:56.930
damage if you set a card in 
the Spell & Trap Card Zone.

00:04:56.930 --> 00:04:58.210
Now what will you do?

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:02.840
Since Jack and Luca don't have many 
life points, they can't do anything.

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:06.190
I have 3200 life points, so 
I'm the one who has to act.

00:05:06.190 --> 00:05:09.210
But if I do, it may happen again.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.710
I can't make any more mistakes.

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:23.510
If I make another mistake, 
Jack and Luca will be...

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.200
I end my turn.

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:27.130
Lua!

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:30.290
Luca!

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:32.330
My turn.

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:34.590
I end my turn.

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:37.310
Oh no.  What was I thinking?

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:41.680
I could've let Luca rest during my turn.

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:48.140
Due to Fortissimo the Mobile 
Fortress's effect, you take

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:52.130
100 points of damage if you don't 
have a Machine-Type monster.

00:05:53.810 --> 00:05:54.510
Luca!

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:58.430
Luca!

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:00.400
Aporia, why?

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:03.120
Why would you hurt a child?

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:05.340
To make you give up.

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:09.600
Give up on saving Neo Domino City.

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:10.940
What?

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:16.310
That's why I'm making you feel 
the same despair that I felt.

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:17.940
Despair?

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:21.150
The despair of losing people who love you.

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:24.450
The despair of losing people to love.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:27.660
The despair of no longer needing love.

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:32.630
In this duel, I'll make you feel 
all the despair that I felt.

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:37.170
Then you'll choose not to evolve anymore.

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:40.840
And Z-one will guide us to a new future.

00:06:42.450 --> 00:06:44.070
I'm not giving up!

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:45.820
I won't despair!

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:48.000
My turn!

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:52.900
I summon the Tuner Monster Clock 
Resonator in defense position!

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:56.040
When Clock Resonator is 
in defense position, it

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:59.410
can't be destroyed in battle 
or by an effect once per turn!

00:06:59.740 --> 00:07:01.770
Jack, why?

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:03.100
If you summon a monster...

00:07:03.460 --> 00:07:06.580
Due to the Continuous Trap Level 
Cannon's effect, Jack takes

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:11.380
damage equal to the summoned monster's 
Level multiplied by 200 points.

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:14.360
You take 600 points of damage.

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:21.140
I end my turn.

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:22.620
Jack...

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:28.420
Clock Resonator is Machine-Type, so you 
won't take damage from Fortissimo's effect.

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:30.090
You're lucky to survive.

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:34.690
But it's pointless to summon a monster in 
defense position if you have to endure pain.

00:07:35.610 --> 00:07:36.570
He's wrong.

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:39.530
Jack is trying to tell me.

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:44.730
That the current situation may 
be bleak, but the future...

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:47.160
So you have hope.

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:50.360
You humans desire hope.

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:54.740
Your hope for Synchro Summoning 
led the world to destruction!

00:07:56.960 --> 00:07:58.850
My turn!

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:02.650
I activate the spell card 
Boon of the Meklord Emperor.

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:08.700
I draw one card for every 
Meklord monster on my field.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:13.100
I have three Meklord Armies on 
my field, so I draw three cards.

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:19.130
I'll destroy all your foolish hopes.

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:23.540
Since I have at least three 
Meklord Armies on my field, I

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:27.790
can Special Summon Meklord Astro 
Dragon Asterisk from my hand.

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:37.940
What is this monster?

00:08:38.610 --> 00:08:42.330
Meklord Astro Dragon Asterisk's 
attack points are equal to the

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:46.400
total attack points of my Machine-Type 
monsters in attack position.

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:50.080
There are three Machine-Type 
monsters on my field.

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:54.660
Therefore, Asterisk has 4600 attack points.

00:08:55.810 --> 00:08:59.580
Oh no!  4600 attack points!

00:09:00.150 --> 00:09:08.070
Since I summoned Level 10 Asterisk, Level 
Cannon usually would deal me 2000 points of damage.

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:13.520
But Meklord Army of Skiel negates effect 
damage when it's 1000 points or more.

00:09:17.230 --> 00:09:23.390
Due to Asterisk's effect, the only 
Machine-Type monster you're allowed to attack is Asterisk.

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:30.680
And if you Special Summon a Synchro 
Monster, you take 1000 points of damage.

00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:33.090
1000 points of damage?

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:36.400
That'll prevent us from Synchro Summoning!

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:41.670
This is the ultimate Meklord Emperor.

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:44.540
Is there really no hope left?

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:48.270
Aporia has four monsters on his field.

00:09:48.430 --> 00:09:50.600
Since he summoned his trump card Asterisk,

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:53.800
that means he's planning 
to end the duel this turn.

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:58.360
Jack's Clock Resonator can't 
be destroyed in battle once.

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:02.480
But if he uses Meklord Army of 
Wisel's piercing effect, he can

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:06.790
attack with his four monsters to 
reduce all our life points to 0.

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:10.430
That means Luca will die.

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:14.650
Luca!

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:18.030
Luca!

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:21.100
It's the same as always.

00:10:21.610 --> 00:10:29.630
I say that I'll protect Luca and be her 
hero, but all I ever do is watch and hope.

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:32.870
Please, God.

00:10:33.430 --> 00:10:35.650
Please save Luca.

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:40.280
Please give some of my life to Luca!

00:10:42.170 --> 00:10:44.160
There was nothing I could do.

00:10:44.550 --> 00:10:46.120
I couldn't do anything for her.

00:10:46.390 --> 00:10:47.580
It's the same now.

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:52.400
No, that's incorrect.

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:54.200
I'm dueling right now.

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.530
I'm connected to Luca through dueling!

00:10:57.190 --> 00:11:00.760
I'm no longer a bystander!

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:02.570
Lua...

00:11:03.020 --> 00:11:05.030
I won't despair!

00:11:05.460 --> 00:11:07.140
There is hope!

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:11.410
Please give some of my life to Luca!

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:18.100
That's right.  My life is my weapon!

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:39.770
It's time to lower the curtains.

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:42.390
The curtains called despair.

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:47.680
Jack, Meklord Army of Skiel 
attacks your Clock Resonator.

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:48.640
Twin Pulse!

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:53.680
I flip over my trap card Block Lock!

00:11:53.680 --> 00:12:00.070
I switch the target of your monster's 
attack to my Morphtronic monster!

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:04.240
Meklord Army of Skiel attacks 
Morphtronic Staplen instead!

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:05.670
Lua!

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:07.640
Staplen's effect activates!

00:12:07.640 --> 00:12:11.310
When Staplen is in defense position, 
it can't be destroyed in battle!

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:14.960
Did you forget about Meklord 
Army of Wisel's effect?

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:18.020
Once per turn, when my monster attacks a

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:21.670
monster in defense position, 
it deals piercing damage!

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:27.480
Lua!

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:31.090
Staplen switches to attack 
position after battle!

00:12:33.710 --> 00:12:36.460
And it switches Meklord 
Army of Skiel and Meklord

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:41.040
Army of Granel from attack 
position to defense position!

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:51.580
Since two monsters have switched to defense 
position, Asterisk's attack points decrease!

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:57.720
You deliberately took damage to do this?

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:02.860
Meklord Army of Wisel attacks Staplen.

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:04.290
Quark Curb!

00:13:12.260 --> 00:13:15.540
You're willing to risk your life this much?

00:13:16.070 --> 00:13:19.170
Staplen's effect activates.

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:26.650
When it's in attack position, the monster 
that destroys it loses 300 attack points.

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:30.330
How insolent.

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:33.970
If you want to die so badly, 
I'll bury you first.

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:37.640
Asterisk attacks you directly.

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:42.110
Infinity Nemesis Stream!

00:13:48.310 --> 00:13:49.220
Lua!

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:50.630
Lua, are you okay?

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:54.170
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:02.630
What's wrong?  Are you done?

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:05.630
There are things you can 
do before you despair.

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:11.190
If you surrender, you're allowed 
to live and end this battle.

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:15.420
You and your teammates won't die.

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:16.290
What?

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:21.360
Lua!

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:25.360
That's right.

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:29.980
If you take the initiative and 
surrender, you won't despair at all.

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:33.160
Lua...

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:42.790
I'm still alive.

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:47.340
As long as I'm alive, I won't despair!

00:14:47.590 --> 00:14:48.430
What?

00:14:49.080 --> 00:14:49.880
Lua!

00:14:49.940 --> 00:14:50.770
Lua!

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:52.960
My turn!

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:57.440
I use the Field Spell Fortissimo 
the Mobile Fortress's effect!

00:14:57.820 --> 00:15:03.710
I Special Summon the Level 4-or-below 
Machine-Type monster Morphtronic Boomboxen from my hand!

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:10.540
Then I summon the Tuner Monster 
Morphtronic Lantron in defense position!

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:15.510
You fool.

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:19.830
You summoned a Level 4 monster 
and a Level 1 monster?

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:22.260
Level Cannon's effect activates!

00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:27.340
Level 5 times 200 points 
equals 1000 points of damage!

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:37.370
Lua!

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:38.880
I won't lose.

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:42.790
I activate the spell card 
Double Ripple from my hand!

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:49.520
We each select a Synchro Monster in our Extra 
Decks with the same Level and Synchro Materials.

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:53.920
By sending the appropriate 
monsters from our fields to the

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:58.690
graveyard, we can Special Summon the 
selected monsters in defense position!

00:15:58.800 --> 00:16:01.250
Lua, what are you trying to do?

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:04.970
I send Level 3 Clock 
Resonator on Jack's field

00:16:04.970 --> 00:16:08.150
and Level 4 Boomboxen on 
my field to the graveyard!

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:18.080
I call forth Level 7 Power Tool Dragon and 
Ancient Fairy Dragon on to my field and Luca's field!

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:20.100
Ancient Fairy Dragon?

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:31.840
You've lost your mind.

00:16:32.110 --> 00:16:37.240
When you Special Summon a Synchro 
Monster, you take 1000 points of damage.

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:40.910
You also take damage from 
Level Cannon's effect.

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:44.230
That's a total of 3800 points of damage!

00:16:44.970 --> 00:16:46.930
Even though Ancient Fairy 
Dragon was summoned on

00:16:46.930 --> 00:16:50.640
to Luca's field, Luca wasn't 
the one who summoned it.

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:51.860
That means...

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:54.690
Lua takes all the damage!

00:16:55.230 --> 00:16:56.280
Oh no!

00:17:08.180 --> 00:17:09.240
That's right.

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:15.320
Humans couldn't stop using 
Synchros and were destroyed.

00:17:15.730 --> 00:17:18.360
Kid, despair and die.

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:20.500
No!  I won't despair!

00:17:20.690 --> 00:17:22.280
There's now hope!

00:17:22.460 --> 00:17:23.440
What?

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:25.480
Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:27.690
Protect Luca!

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:30.150
No!

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:31.890
Feel the anger of the heavens!

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:33.600
Nemesis Tornado!

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:02.950
Lua!

00:18:03.150 --> 00:18:04.930
No!

00:18:05.210 --> 00:18:06.530
Lua!

00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:15.590
What?

00:18:15.590 --> 00:18:18.410
Why is she losing life points 
when she hasn't taken any damage?

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:22.160
I told you that your life and 
your life points are linked.

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:26.360
If your spirit weakens, you lose life points.

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:27.160
Luca!

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:29.120
Lua!

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:29.790
Lua!

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:31.420
Lua...

00:18:35.610 --> 00:18:38.630
You still have a mission to complete.

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:43.660
Lua, you're the only one who can save Luca.

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:46.100
Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:18:51.050 --> 00:18:52.460
What's this effect?

00:18:52.850 --> 00:18:53.860
I remember!

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:57.910
When your life points become 
0 while Lantron is in defense

00:18:58.090 --> 00:19:02.390
position, your life points change from 
0 to 100 if the light stops on green!

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:14.720
What's this?

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:21.640
My mark!

00:19:21.850 --> 00:19:23.540
Someone is battling.

00:19:23.540 --> 00:19:27.310
Yeah, and he needs our power.

00:19:28.940 --> 00:19:32.040
This glow is different than before.

00:19:32.250 --> 00:19:34.400
I sense something new.

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:49.150
Lua is...

00:19:53.640 --> 00:19:55.780
Lua is a Signer.

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:07.910
Lua!

00:20:08.480 --> 00:20:11.050
Impossible!  The kid evolved into a Signer!

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:18.460
Lua.

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:22.320
You are the sixth Signer.

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:25.260
I'm a Signer?

00:20:26.180 --> 00:20:29.420
I have the same power 
as Yusei, Jack and Luca?

00:20:29.940 --> 00:20:31.230
Yes.

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:35.930
Luca and I were always hoping 
that this would happen.

00:20:35.930 --> 00:20:39.270
I believed that you would mature.

00:20:39.470 --> 00:20:41.650
Ancient Fairy Dragon...

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:48.010
I'll use my Signer's power to save Luca!

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:51.760
Mark of the Crimson Dragon, give me power!

00:20:55.140 --> 00:21:00.270
Level 1 Lantron tunes 
Level 7 Power Tool Dragon!

00:21:00.550 --> 00:21:01.730
What?

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:06.170
In order to protect the future of the world, 
courage and power have a revolution!

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:08.530
Crimson Dragon!

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:09.570
No way!

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:13.030
Synchro Summon!

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:15.180
Evolve, Life Stream Dragon!

00:21:34.010 --> 00:21:38.580
This is Signer Lua's new dragon.

00:22:05.140 --> 00:22:10.340
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:10.480 --> 00:22:15.680
If we shed the same tears, let's laugh together

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:21.050
Freed reality forms phrases in the piercing beat

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:23.790
Our hearts resonate

00:22:23.790 --> 00:22:29.030
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:29.160 --> 00:22:35.670
We'll find a place for us

00:22:37.570 --> 00:22:42.410
Waking in a dream  Stretch our hands toward the future

00:22:42.410 --> 00:22:47.480
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:48.210 --> 00:22:53.650
Repaint the darkness with the colors we envision

00:22:53.650 --> 00:23:02.230
Overlaying memories, bonds and hope creates future color

00:23:02.230 --> 00:23:07.830
We will draw it forever
